### termux-rootbridge: extra keys, two rows of six.
### S-TAB sends Shift+Tab (Claude Code cycles plan / auto / bypass with it; phone keyboards have none),
### TAB completes slash commands and @files. KEYBOARD shows or hides the soft keyboard (ENTER, the arrows
### and ESC then still work). Swipe up on LEFT for HOME, on RIGHT for END.
extra-keys = [['ESC','CTRL',{macro: "SHIFT TAB", display: "S-TAB"},'BKSP','UP','ENTER'], ['KEYBOARD','/','TAB',{key: 'LEFT', popup: 'HOME'},'DOWN',{key: 'RIGHT', popup: 'END'}]]
